{"title":"Career roadmap · Tour Operator","role":"Tour Operator","summary":"Career alignment: A Tour Operator designs, packages, coordinates and sells travel experiences by combining transportation, accommodation, sightseeing, activities, guides, meals and other travel services into itineraries for individual or group travellers.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines tourism knowledge","itinerary planning","supplier management","sales","costing","customer service","operations","digital marketing","travel technology."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong Tour Operator should be able to take a traveller's requirements and turn them into a feasible, attractive, safe and commercially viable travel package."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Tour Executive / Travel Executive"},{"text":"Reservations, itineraries and customer support"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Tour Coordinator / Tour Operations Executive"},{"text":"End-to-end trip coordination"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Tour Operator / Tour Manager"},{"text":"Package creation and operations"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Senior Tour Manager / Product Manager"},{"text":"Destination/product ownership"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Operations Manager / Travel Business Manager"},{"text":"Team and business management"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Head of Tour Operations / Travel Business Head"},{"text":"Portfolio and strategy"}],[{"text":"Entrepreneurial"},{"text":"Tour Operator / Travel Entrepreneur"},{"text":"Own travel company"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Tourism & Travel Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Business fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","